    "sections": {
        "description": "Trendy Storefront is a modern and versatile electronics and gadget store theme designed for online retailers, tech shops, and multipurpose ecommerce businesses. With a clean and organized layout, this responsive ecommerce theme is perfect for showcasing electronics, smart devices, accessories, appliances, and digital products in a professional way. The stylish homepage sections, featured product areas, and category-based layouts help customers browse products easily while creating an engaging online shopping experience. Built with WooCommerce compatibility, Trendy Storefront allows you to manage products, highlight promotions, and organize collections effortlessly. Its customizable design, fast-loading performance, and SEO-friendly structure make it an ideal shop theme for growing online stores and modern retailers. Whether you sell smart watches, laptops, cameras, speakers, or lifestyle gadgets, this customizable ecommerce shop theme delivers a smooth, mobile-friendly, and visually appealing storefront that helps businesses build a strong and professional online presence."
    },
